      "content": "While stress and anxiety can cause physical symptoms like chest pressure and numness, it's also possible that there are other underlying causes to consider. Heart problems, such as a heart condition or anxiety-related tachycardia, can cause chest pressure and arm symptoms. However, in the absence of other symptoms, stress and anxiety are likely contributing factors. It's a good idea to talk to a healthcare professional to rule out any underlying conditions.",
